* text=auto eol=lf

# A PDF is bytes, and this repo bundles one whose xref table stores byte
# offsets (apps/api/app/domain/assets/docling_warmup.pdf, #24). Left under
# `text=auto` git reads it as text, because it happens to carry no NUL byte,
# and any future eol normalisation would move every offset it names.
*.pdf binary
